# Job Platform — Root Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
#
# Each submodule has its own .env.example:
#   job-platform-api/.env.example  — Spring Boot backend config
#   fastapi-ai/.env.example        — FastAPI AI service config
#
# The root .env is currently unused; docker-compose reads
# environment variables directly from compose.yaml.
